@startuml
actor "Zotero" as Zotero

boundary "同步服务界面" as SyncServiceUI

control "Zotero 同步控制器" as ZoteroSyncController

entity "文献数据库实体" as BibDatabaseEntity
entity "PDF 库实体" as PdfLibraryEntity
entity "引文实体" as CitationEntity

Zotero -> SyncServiceUI : 导出 BetterBibTeX JSON 更新
SyncServiceUI -> ZoteroSyncController : 通知数据库变更(path)

ZoteroSyncController -> BibDatabaseEntity : 加载 JSON(path)
BibDatabaseEntity --> ZoteroSyncController : bibRecords

ZoteroSyncController -> PdfLibraryEntity : 扫描工作区 PDF()
PdfLibraryEntity --> ZoteroSyncController : pdfList

ZoteroSyncController -> CitationEntity : 匹配(pdfList, bibRecords)
CitationEntity --> ZoteroSyncController : mappingResult

ZoteroSyncController -> CitationEntity : 更新本地缓存(mappingResult)
ZoteroSyncController -> SyncServiceUI : 显示同步状态(成功)
@enduml